_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af__NEggCkyYaZHS6p3dt74XhHaHZsVwjXRaa7v1gJRRVA&oe=6A41473F"}, {"file_name": "thumbnail six.png", "id": "1876583566474274", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391911_1876583569807607_8034973670934466146_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_W-m2AXdyXEQ7kNvwFU9mDP&_nc_oc=AdqxGrReFMFTOE4V_zeisvBfowLHYwNn8BVpUGKsC9oXVJeN1-y7NHgo-NFzL5eRzb0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_8zNcglniTewlLYKyLx7iHxyvi5GwIH9j2aaay9dDLfg&oe=6A412B57"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "2231284957226545", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982499_2231284960559878_7927798837045485971_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BVrIQ9yH2tsQ7kNvwGHJjoV&_nc_oc=Adp4-SEU5QsPc_AylFNDsvbVPC5F3yBDO3JJAvquMAQlRiHzEpg4IEtZ9qAAP4SbW48&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9oxcrzEn0eGbHjsUiAjoHGQhTQicIDY2hgkU7C1m9ieQ&oe=6A411F33"}, "display_name": "Final Overs - VR Cricket", "keywords": ["Cricket", "Sports", "ibcricket", "vrcricket", "cricketbat"], "long_description": "Play the world\u2019s second most popular sport with 2+ billion fans now in an epic VR cricket experience. Final Overs takes cricket gaming to the next level in VR with innovative physics, aesthetic world-class stadiums, & many more exciting gameplay features.\n\nStep into the jam-packed virtual stadiums & establish your cricketing legacy as an aspiring cricketer. Take on AI-powered bowling side, or compete with your friends in local multiplayer matches. \n\n{1023212629369308}\n\nWorld-class matches in **aesthetic stadiums**\n\n{668555419152122}\n\nFully immersive experience with **realistic physics**\n\n{1048927140621971}\n\nThrilling matches against **international teams**\n\n{566880399852693}\n\nPolish your batting skills with **timing meter**\n\n{692412490107446}\n\nChallenge friends in **local multiplayer** mode using mobile\n\n{1230393305762003}\n\n**OTHER FEATURES:**\n\n- Multiple cricket formats: quick match, T20, ODI\n- Track your progress in your profile\n- AI-driven intelligent fielding & bowling system\n- AI Coach match summary & tips\n- Multiple difficulty levels\n- Immersive world-class stadiums\n- Practice net\n- Regular updates\n\nThese, and many other incoming features make Final Overs worth the experience. DOWNLOAD now and rise as a star in VR cricket!", "short_description": "Bring your cricketing dreams to reality in this highly immersive VR cricket game! "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://finalovers.cricket/PrivacyPolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mixeal", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://finalovers.cricket/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9814793011922517"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974888_702288425421610_1326782060541322224_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C0jwowh2CZgQ7kNvwEP-IEv&_nc_oc=AdqKaAq1cL1dJUI7shwDijnnkH6XT1Zsir9sGhHFa6U4BNk3dS5lZUAhBDC9IObIOXU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_Ux1Z2p2RQMifb-pxzy7USh5YEa1GsyHQm2j_Wuq57Rw&oe=6A413CC1"}